    {
      "subId": "7109807",
      "subQuestName": "Hand Over Delicious Radish Veggie Soup",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [],
        "dialogs": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7109808",
      "subQuestName": "Talk to Garcia",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "710981501"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "710981501": {
            "id": "710981501",
            "speakerId": 20657,
            "speakerName": "Garcia",
            "text": "This flavor is mighty fine indeed, but I must say that it tastes entirely different from the Radish Veggie Soup that Mr. Yanxiao makes.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710981502"
            ]
          },
          "710981502": {
            "id": "710981502",
            "speakerId": 20657,
            "speakerName": "Garcia",
            "text": "Pardon my curiosity, but how... how did you make this dish? What were the exact amounts of ingredients? What seasonings did you use, and how?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710981505"
            ]
          },
          "710981505": {
            "id": "710981505",
            "speakerId": 20657,
            "speakerName": "Garcia",
            "text": "Ah, yes... my apologies. Still, I would like to know how you made that dish. In detail, please — you never know how the inspiration might come.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710981506"
            ]
          },
          "710981506": {
            "id": "710981506",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Black Screen",
            "text": "You explain the manner in which you make Radish Veggie Soup in detail.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710981507"
            ]
          },
          "710981507": {
            "id": "710981507",
            "speakerId": 20657,
            "speakerName": "Garcia",
            "text": "I see...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710981508"
            ]
          },
          "710981508": {
            "id": "710981508",
            "speakerId": 20657,
            "speakerName": "Garcia",
            "text": "*sigh* Ah, there truly are too many variables involved in deciding the flavor of a single dish. Much computation is needed to refine our calculations.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710981509"
            ]
          },
          "710981509": {
            "id": "710981509",
            "speakerId": 20657,
            "speakerName": "Garcia",
            "text": "But I will need to improve my Numbering Machine to allow for more computations...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710981510"
            ]
          },
          "710981510": {
            "id": "710981510",
            "speakerId": 20657,
            "speakerName": "Garcia",
            "text": "I can only hope that I can find some inspiration in the Akademiya's library.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710981511"
            ]
          },
          "710981511": {
            "id": "710981511",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Why did you want to create such a machine, anyway?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710981512"
            ]
          },
          "710981512": {
            "id": "710981512",
            "speakerId": 20657,
            "speakerName": "Garcia",
            "text": "Hmm. Good question. But before I answer that question, permit me to ask you one first.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710981513"
            ]
          },
          "710981513": {
            "id": "710981513",
            "speakerId": 20657,
            "speakerName": "Garcia",
            "text": "Do you think that the Numbering Machine possesses \"thought\"?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7109803",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "710980301"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "710980301": {
            "id": "710980301",
            "speakerId": 2204,
            "speakerName": "Smiley Yanxiao",
            "text": "I don't get it. How can people not figure out how to make Radish Veggie Soup...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710980302"
            ]
          },
          "710980302": {
            "id": "710980302",
            "speakerId": 2204,
            "speakerName": "Smiley Yanxiao",
            "text": "Also, how am I supposed to know the exact amount of... well, anything I put into dishes when I make them, huh!?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710980303"
            ]
          },
          "710980303": {
            "id": "710980303",
            "speakerId": 2204,
            "speakerName": "Smiley Yanxiao",
            "text": "Don't you just put however much you like and just go with the flow? Seriously, no chef ever sweats over this stuff!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710980304"
            ]
          },
          "710980304": {
            "id": "710980304",
            "speakerId": 2204,
            "speakerName": "Smiley Yanxiao",
            "text": "If it wasn't for the Mora they forked up, I would've taken my complaints up to the boss a long time ago...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710980305"
            ]
          },
          "710980305": {
            "id": "710980305",
            "speakerId": 2204,
            "speakerName": "Smiley Yanxiao",
            "text": "Ugh, it's just my luck, running into people like them..."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7109811",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "710981101"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "710981101": {
            "id": "710981101",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Wow, looks like Garcia's put the fire on the stove out as well.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710981102"
            ]
          },
          "710981102": {
            "id": "710981102",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Let's get it back on, shall we?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7109812",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "710981201"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "710981201": {
            "id": "710981201",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Alright! Let's make us some Radish Veggie Soup."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7109813",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "710981301"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "710981301": {
            "id": "710981301",
            "speakerId": 14068,
            "speakerName": "Garcia",
            "text": "This parameter... No, no, I need to adjust the algorithm...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710981302"
            ]
          },
          "710981302": {
            "id": "710981302",
            "speakerId": 14069,
            "speakerName": "Lutong",
            "text": "Sir, I believe that we should aim to be thrifty in our expenditures, lest we lack sufficient Mora for our journey to Sumeru.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710981303"
            ]
          },
          "710981303": {
            "id": "710981303",
            "speakerId": 14068,
            "speakerName": "Garcia",
            "text": "Sumeru? Ah, yes, right you are, Lutong. Once we get to Sumeru, I shall surely be able to find some way to refine this Numbering Machine of mine.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710981304"
            ]
          },
          "710981304": {
            "id": "710981304",
            "speakerId": 14068,
            "speakerName": "Garcia",
            "text": "Then, my Numbering Machine shall be able to perform ever grander calculations...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710981305"
            ]
          },
          "710981305": {
            "id": "710981305",
            "speakerId": 14069,
            "speakerName": "Lutong",
            "text": "...I fully concur with your statement, sir."
          }
        }
      }
    }
  ]
}